
[GENERAL]
Briefing_LAMBERT=LAMBERT - We arrived just in time to stop the biological attack at Grand Central Station. But it’s not time to relax yet. Colonel Kim fled and we do not know whether and where he could attack again. The only trace we have comes from the analysis of the bombs you defused. It revealed a connection with a Nuclear Power Plant in Yongbyon, North Korea. The 3 double-laser detonators used in the attack come from there. CIA suspected it was a cover for Military Research. Now we've got the evidence. Colonel Kim cannot have organized everything by himself. Someone at Yongbyon must have helped him. Find out how many detonators Kim got and who helped him.
MapName=NUCLEAR PLANT
